48\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2\">\\(r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(x)\">\\(O(x)\\)</span> 精确取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d0116d2c9f5af20f\" href=\"?note=d0116d2c9f5af20f\" title=\"89-df-analysis-provability\">89-df-analysis-provability</a> 中定义的公式，不替换为任意标准模型外延相同的公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner_2\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner_2\\)</span>、数词、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_2=\\neg(0=0)\">\\(\\bot_2=\\neg(0=0)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ab645f955c77848\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>，翻译按有限语法树递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_0 A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_1 A)&amp;\\coloneqq O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_0 A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_1 A)&amp;\\coloneqq O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留普通分析可证性与完整 omega 可证性作为两种不同的盒解释。二阶语言、有限证明、代码操作和 O 已由本书内部文件给出；不再以未提供的“第 14 章固定公式”作为定义内容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","status":"resolved","id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"571457cbee377421","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-a